      "title": "DIAMETER: Allow Requested-Service-Unit no value",
      "message": "DIAMETER: Allow Requested-Service-Unit no value\n\nAccording to RFC 4006 AVP=Requested-Service-Unit may has not value.\nAt present moment Wiresark adds expert info of type \"Warning\" and it\nconfused.\n\nFrom Nokia documentaion:\n(https://documentation.nokia.com/sr/23-7-2/books/gy-avps-reference/diameter-gy-ccr-command.html)\n\n> Requested-Service-Unit: When included, the Requested-Service-Unit AVP has an empty data field\n> in all CCR Initial/Update messages.\n",
